        "text": {
          "text": "位於跑馬地市政大樓熟食中心的港式大貝池有兩家，相鄰而坐。若您有偏好，請留意座位安排。兩家餐廳都很不錯，各有特色菜。您可以向服務生諮詢推薦。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "A Hong Kong Styled Tai Pei Tong housed in the cooked food centre of the muncipal builidng in Happy Valley. There are two of the same located next to one another. You need to pay attention to seating if you have preference to a particular one. Both are equally good and has their own signature dishes. Just as the waiter or waitress for recommendation.",
